WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:01.540
What's the matter-why do you look so glum?  Do you have a stomach ache or something?

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:02.970
That's strange.

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:05.260
What's strange Chōhi?

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.000
That’s what!

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:08.230
Huh?

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:11.360
We made a vow of sisterhood but…

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:15.230
Why don’t you call me by my real name, Rin Rin?

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.680
Families usually call each other by their real name, that’s why I am upset!

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:23.350
That’s true, but…  We haven’t been together for a long time, so…

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:28.860
I want to call you by your real name, but you haven’t told…

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.340
Okay, I understand.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:37.330
My name is Kan'u Unchō…
But my real name is Aisha.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:40.790
I would like you to call me Aisha from now on.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.250
Is this alright with you Rin Rin?

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.150
Yes.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:51.210
<b>Kan'u is Going to Die with Chōun</b>

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:57.490
One moment please?

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:58.890
What is it?

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:04.880
I am sorry to bother you…  But are you the black hair bandit hunter?

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:08.860
Well, there seems to be people who are calling me that, but…

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.910
I don’t go by that name.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:15.050
Well that’s good.  Ever since I heard about her in a nearby village...

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.910
I’ve been looking for travelers matching her description.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:21.840
I was told she's a bewitching beauty, with gorgeous black hair.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.170
I almost overlooked you!

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.650
Really...

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:31.100
In this case, I must let my master know that you are here.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.470
Please wait here for a moment.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:35.600
Yeah...

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.190
Aisha, you’re famous for your beauty.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.940
Yes, at least my black hair is!

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.120
Please sit down.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.600
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:03.790
My name is Kousonsan Hakukei.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:09.800
I am the ruling adviser for this region.
This person is a traveling martial artist as well.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:14.630
My name is Chōun Shiryū.  It‘s a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:20.180
She’s staying here as my acting general.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:25.230
It is a great honor to meet you both.  I am Kan'u Unchō,

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:26.830
And this is …

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.380
I am Rin Rin.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:33.270
Hey, you have to introduce yourself properly.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.370
Kan'u.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.380
You seem too young to have a daughter her age.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:44.830
N-no, you have it all wrong!  Rin Rin is not my daughter; we came together as strangers and made a sisterhood vow…

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.330
Oh, a vow of sisterhood?

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.560
So who’s the attacker and who’s the receiver?

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:55.510
If it was my choice, I would be the attacker.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:59.860
Hey, don’t answer without having a clue!

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:01.830
So what is she asking then?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.480
It means...

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:08.920
Okay, then let’s leave this topic for another time.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:12.360
I’d like to ask a favor.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.810
Who, me?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.780
I am Lord of a remote and small land, but...

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:21.300
I am worried, now more than ever about the world.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:25.100
Enshō of Kishuu, Sonaku of Koutuu,

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.840
And Sōsō, who are gaining prominence in the capital.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:34.060
I heard all those who aspire to rule are recruiting talented fighters.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.420
With the power of the old Kan Dynasty lost.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:41.670
Please lend me your strength to rectify this era of chaos.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:48.690
Lord Kousonsan, I am sorry to interrupt you, but don't you think you are jumping to conclusions??

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.140
What do you mean?

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:55.860
I have heard rumors of the black hair bandit hunter during my travels as well.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:59.830
But rumors tend to be exaggerated.

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.290
Well, that is true…

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:10.000
We should put Kan'u’s abilities to test before inviting her to join our cause.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.370
I see your point.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:16.570
If you have no objection, I will take care of this for you.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.310
You won’t have a problem with a trial?

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.730
Would you please have a match with Chōun?

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.760
W-well, I am…

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.770
Are you getting cold feet?

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:28.940
No way!

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:30.220
Hey, Rin Rin.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.250
Aisha is verrry strong.

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:36.950
And she will not lose to the likes of you.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.410
There is no need for her to fight.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:43.730
Instead, I will beat the hell out of you.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:47.290
My, my, you are so sure of yourself.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:52.120
Then why don’t we test your confidence against my skills?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.120
Let’s do this!

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.110
Begin!

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:13.490
I see.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.140
You only dance around and dodge my attacks!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.750
What?  You finished already?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:36.730
Not yet!

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.470
Rin Rin, that’s enough!

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:43.900
Why did you stop me?  I can still fight!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.140
I know.

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:48.600
I just feel like fighting myself.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:06.690
Now.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:17.380
I can recognize a strong opponent without engaging in battle.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.580
Lord Kousonsan, I can vouch for Kan'u’s fighting abilities.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:23.730
Okay.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.550
What?!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.950
What’s with the sullen face now, Rin Rin?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:37.940
She‘s insinuating that I am not a very strong fighter.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.230
Well, that’s…

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:45.460
You are indeed strong, Chōhi.  But, you don’t know how to use your own strength.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:51.990
By the way, Lord Kousonsan, about what we were discussing yesterday…

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.480
You mean Shakudouzan.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.460
What do you mean by Shakudouzan?

00:08:56.900 --> 00:09:01.430
I am embarrassed to admit, but I am having trouble with bandits.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:04.690
Judging by their activities...

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.930
Their hideout must be somewhere in the Shakudouzan mountain.

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:14.260
So far, we have not been able to find it in order to send in troops and disband them.

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.900
After hearing the problem, I came up with a plan.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.600
So, what is the plan?

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:24.640
We organize a fake caravan and hide inside one of the containers...

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:28.180
We let the bandits attack the caravan and take the containers and us, to their hideout.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:32.320
In other words, we let them show us where their hideout is.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.790
I see.  It sounds like fun.

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:38.990
But breaking into the bandit's hideout all alone is...

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:41.430
“You don't get to taste the honey, without the sting of the bee”.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:46.240
In order to apprehend the sneaky bandits, a little danger is expected.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:51.310
So Kan'u, would you like to pay a visit to the bandits’ hideout with me?

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.310
I’ll take you up on your offer.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.260
I am going too!

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.990
<b>NO WAY!</b>

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:55.980
I am sorry but you can’t go!

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.530
Why is that?

00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:04.490
Listen, it takes lots of patience to be quiet while hiding in the container.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:08.450
I don’t think you know the meaning of the word, quiet!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:11.550
You probably can’t stay still for a minute.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:15.880
That‘s not true, I can do anything I want if I put my mind to it!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.840
Then why don't we just give it a try here?

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.580
That’s nothing!

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:24.540
I just simply sit still here like this!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:28.170
<b>1 minute later...</b>

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.550
<b>5 minutes later...</b>

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.010
<b>10 minutes later...</b>

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:36.760
Rin Rin!

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:40.240
Are you okay?  Answer me?  Open your eyes!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:44.680
My god you have a fever!  Lord Kousonsan, please call a doctor, now!  Please hurry!

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.130
Are we hiding in here?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.220
Yes.  It’s a bit tight, but it can’t be helped.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:56.710
We have to stay really close in order for our bodies to fit.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:01.660
Don’t worry, I am very eager to feel your body next to mine.

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.390
I see, then…  What?!

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.850
What do you mean eager…!???

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.230
Ch- Chōun...

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:23.740
We don't know when the bandits will strike, so no chit-chatting.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:28.180
I know but your knees are…

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.660
Is there anything wrong with my knees?

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:34.410
Stop it…

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:57.110
Lord Kounsonsan.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:58.730
What is the matter?

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:02.810
We received reports that the caravan was attacked by the bandits.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.270
So it happened!

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:09.230
Yes.  There were no injuries to the posing merchants.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:12.670
And the goods fell in the hands of the bandits as planned.

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:16.390
Leave it over here.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.070
Okay, here?

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.290
What’s the matter?

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.380
I thought I heard a woman’s voice just now.

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:29.860
What are you talking about, brother?

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:32.780
You must be really hungry to be hallucinating?

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.320
That must be it!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.440
Alright then, let’s have the village girl serve us some sake.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:38.810
Another feast!

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:40.300
Drink as much as you want!

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.610
We are still in one piece.

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:57.560
It looks like we are somewhere underground.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:58.240
Underground?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.660
This place probably was an old mine.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:08.000
So they use the shafts as a hideout.

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.840
No wonder we couldn’t find them.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:16.800
It‘s larger than we thought, it’s going to be a real pain to find our way out.

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:23.220
If we are attacked this is the only weapon I have, that worries me.

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:28.360
Because of the size of your boobs, we couldn’t fit a larger weapon.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:33.660
My breasts were not the only ones taking up space!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:39.710
Hum, you are right.  Your buns might have taken more space than your boobs.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.630
No.  Please stop.  I beg of you.

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:58.560
Oh yeah!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:05.020
Come on baby, don't be stingy...

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:07.620
It's not gonna shrink if I touch, or is it?!

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:10.430
Bastard, forcing himself on her like that.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.190
I will punish him for this.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:14.200
Kan'u, what are you planning?

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.910
Plan or no plan I am going to save her.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:23.460
But they outnumber us. Our mission was to discover their hideout…

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:24.110
Hey!

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.220
That’s enough you filthy pig!

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:43.100
Are you okay?

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.960
Y-yes…

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:46.600
Who the heck are you?

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:49.350
I am Kan'u Unchō.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:55.520
You sneaky underground lurking bandits!  Your blood will become the rust on my Green Dragon Crescent Blade…

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.110
Huh?!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.590
What was it that you were going to do to us again?

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:02.650
What an idiot!

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:11.970
This would be enough to take care of you guys.  Come and face me if you have a death wish!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:15.870
You took the words right out my mouth!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.060
W-what the…?  Does she have a partner?

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:31.940
Somebody bring some light!

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.270
Kan'u, this way!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.450
Chōun!

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.550
It seems like they didn’t chase us.

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:55.680
Geez!  I thought only your sister was a hot head.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.650
It appears you are too.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:58.600
Sorry…

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.330
Well...

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:02.290
Thank you for saving me.

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:06.000
There is no need to thank me, I only did what was right.

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:10.760
I live in a village on the foot of this mountain.

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:17.140
While picking wild flowers with the village children, I accidentally found the entrance to the mine.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:20.780
I see. That’s how you got caught.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:24.660
Actually, the children are kept as prisoner here.

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:29.610
I don’t know what will happen to them if they find out, I escaped.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.090
So what do you plan to do now?

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:33.570
Save them of course.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.050
Just as I thought.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.800
Chōhi did what?

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:46.330
Yes.  She said since Kan'u was late returning from her mission, she will attempt to find them herself.

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:52.600
How is she going to the hideout?  The purpose of this mission was to find the hideout.

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:55.960
I reminded her of that, but…She said things will work out when she gets there,

00:16:56.010 --> 00:17:00.930
She said things will work out when she gets there, and asked me where Shakudouzan was?

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.540
Did you tell her?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.500
Yes… Then, she just blew out of here.

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.330
I’M LOST!!

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:24.750
This is just great!  Now I can’t help Aisha.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:30.510
Oh yeah, grandpa used to tell me, if I get lost in the mountain, just look at the tree stumps.

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:36.700
Hmm, since the side rings are wider toward the south, so…

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.510
This way!

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:45.650
Geez, this is boring.

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:48.080
How unlucky.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:21.040
I got the keys.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.820
Miss, do you have any idea where the exit is?

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.120
No, I am sorry.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:32.280
Hey, I found them!  This way!

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:43.370
An exit!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:04.370
Now, thinking about it, going south was not the right idea!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.830
Aisha!!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.430
I finally found you!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.030
Rin Rin?

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:25.430
What are you doing over there?

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:28.790
Rin Rin, cut that tree toward my direction.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.850
Why?

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.720
Hurry up and do it!

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.670
Understood!

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.030
Use this tree trunk to cross and escape to the other side.

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:50.770
Come, everyone.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:51.490
Okay.

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:54.180
No, I am scared.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:55.630
Hang in there.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.890
This is bad, they found us.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.720
It’s alright.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:06.300
Everyone, please stay calm.

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:18.730
What a relief.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.030
AISHA!

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:42.510
That was close.

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:45.470
But the makeshift bridge…

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.750
Looks like we are finished.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:55.210
We need to prepare for the worst.

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:55.960
Yes.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:03.270
It’s a dull sword, but it’s better than nothing.  Let’s go Chōun.

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:04.160
Sei.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:10.200
Since we’re hell bound together, you should call me by my true name.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:14.660
I got it, Sei.  Then call me Aisha.

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:17.160
Alright then, let’s go, Aisha.

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:17.740
Yes.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:30.580
Surround them and attack.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:38.520
That’s strange.  I feel confident having you as my back up, Aisha.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.130
Same here.  Sei, I trust you as my back up as well.

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:44.360
Let’s do it!

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:52.770
Lord Kousonsan.

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.330
What is it?

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:57.740
Miss Kan'u and Miss Chōun have returned.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.240
So they returned?

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:03.790
Yes.  They found the bandits’ hideout, but…

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:09.700
They proceeded to apprehend the bandits by themselves.

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:14.710
All the bandits against two of them?  Then, where do I get to show off?

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:16.450
Unfortunately…

00:22:16.720 --> 00:22:22.680
Riding on a white horse, gloriously.  The white horse riding lord, Kousonsan arrives to save the day!

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:23.680
When do I get to do something like that?

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:28.050
Really…

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:36.210
But… was it alright?

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:39.290
We weren’t planning on staying but...

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:45.560
You could have become a full-fledged general and have an army under your command.

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:51.540
Lord Kousonsan is a nice person.  But that’s all.

00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:56.260
She is not a capable ruler for these troubled times, and her presence is of no significance.

00:22:56.590 --> 00:22:59.000
You are being quite hard on her.

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:04.980
Underneath this blue sky, there is a true master worthy of my services.

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:10.430
And furthermore, it’s more fun to hang out with you guys.

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:36.120
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:41.420
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:47.070
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:51.810
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:51.890 --> 00:23:56.930
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:56.980 --> 00:24:02.100
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:24:02.150 --> 00:24:07.050
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:14.830
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:14.980 --> 00:24:19.980
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:25.240
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:25.240 --> 00:24:30.290
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:30.330 --> 00:24:35.470
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:45.010 --> 00:24:51.680
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
